<p>Call a streak of lightning on your target, dealing <acronym class="variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00,<br>mindpower 100">83, 112, 134, 153, 169</acronym> to <acronym class="variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00,<br>mindpower 100">249, 335, 402, 458, 508</acronym> lightning damage.</p><p>If it is wet the lightning propagates to all foes in radius <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">1, 2, 3, 3, 4,</acronym> doing the same damage to each.</p><p>All affected foes are seared for 4 turns, reducing their fire resistance by <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">15%, 23%, 29%, 35%, 40%</acronym> and and mind save by <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">15, 23, 29, 35, 40.</acronym></p><p>The damage will increase with your Mindpower.</p>